B.ael=new A.ap("How do I get something done?","Open Get Help, describe what you need, set a price or request a quote, and a nearby Runner takes it on. You confirm when the work is complete.")
B.ae5=new A.ap("When am I charged?","Your card is held for the amount shown at booking. You're charged only after the job is completed and confirmed, up to that amount \u2014 never more.")
